Subject: [PATCH] W1-03 Fastutil: map swap benchmark

Integer-key workload across hashmap (boxed baseline) / adapted view /
primitive direct forms; records allocation rate and GC pause deltas so
each future NMS swap site can cite measured numbers (Gate rule).
